§ `s 4 and Articles 3, 4`

#ASSERT `the Convention applies to the child` `a child of 8 brought in 6 months ago`
#ASSERT NOT `the Convention applies to the child` `a child of 16`
#ASSERT `the Convention applies to the child` `a child of 15`
#ASSERT NOT `the Convention applies to the child` `a removal before the Convention came into force`
#ASSERT NOT `the Convention applies to the child` `a child from a non-Contracting State`

#ASSERT `the removal or retention is wrongful` `a child of 8 brought in 6 months ago`
#ASSERT NOT `the removal or retention is wrongful` `a parent who was not exercising custody`
#ASSERT NOT `the removal or retention is wrongful` `a removal in breach of no custody right`

§ `Articles 12, 13, 17, 18, 20`

#ASSERT `the Court must order return` `a child of 8 brought in 6 months ago`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court must order return` `a parent who was not exercising custody`
#ASSERT `the Court must order return` `a settled child after 11 months`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court must order return` `a settled child after 12 months`
#ASSERT `the Court must order return` `an unsettled child after 24 months`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court must order return` `a parent who consented`
#ASSERT `the Court must order return` `an abductor holding a Singapore custody order`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court must order return` `a child of 16`

#ASSERT `the Court may refuse return` `a settled child after 12 months`
#ASSERT `the Court may refuse return` `a parent who consented`
#ASSERT `the Court may refuse return` `a child at grave risk`
#ASSERT `the Court may refuse return` `a mature child who objects`
#ASSERT `the Court may refuse return` `a return offending human rights`
#ASSERT NOT `the Court may refuse return` `a settled child after 11 months`

§ `ss 6, 7, 21 and Article 27`

#ASSERT `what the Central Authority of Singapore offers` `custody breached and child brought into Singapore` EQUALS `help with voluntary return or amicable resolution`
#ASSERT `what the Central Authority of Singapore offers` `custody breached and child taken from Singapore to a Contracting State` EQUALS `claim sent to the foreign Central Authority`
#ASSERT `what the Central Authority of Singapore offers` `access breached and child in Singapore` EQUALS `help with amicable resolution of access`
#ASSERT `what the Central Authority of Singapore offers` `access breached and child in a Contracting State` EQUALS `claim sent to the foreign Central Authority`
#ASSERT `what the Central Authority of Singapore offers` `child taken to a State that is not a Contracting State` EQUALS `no Central Authority route under the Act`

#ASSERT `the custody application is safe from refusal` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the custody application is safe from refusal` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the custody application is safe from refusal` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the custody application is safe from refusal` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE

§ `ss 8, 11, 13, 14`

#ASSERT `may apply to the Court for return` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `may apply to the Court for return` FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `an injunction under s 11 is available` `no application made`
#ASSERT `an injunction under s 11 is available` `application pending`
#ASSERT `an injunction under s 11 is available` `application dismissed`
#ASSERT NOT `an injunction under s 11 is available` `return ordered`

#ASSERT NOT `a custody, care and control or access decision may be made` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `a custody, care and control or access decision may be made` TRUE TRUE
